	(text "Low band: up to 3.4 GHz (LO1 = f + 3.4 GHz), filtered, then down to 12 MHz (LO2 = 3.388 or 3.402 GHz).\nHigh band: straight into the second mixer (LO2 = f +/- 12 MHz)."
